  {"section":"4.3.2","page":59,"text":"Is maith liom na filí móra."},
  {"section":"4.3.2","page":59,"text":"Is maith liom dánta na bhfilí móra."},
  {"section":"4.3.2","page":59,"text":"Foilsíonn an t-údarás áitiúil tuarascáil gach bliain."},
  {"section":"4.3.2","page":59,"text":"Foilsíodh tuarascálacha na n-údarás áitiúil."},
  {"section":"4.3.3","page":59,"text":"Cén chaoi a bhfuil tú, a athair beag?"},
  {"section":"4.3.3","page":59,"text":"A dheartháir dílis, bhí a fhios agam go maith gur tú a bhí ann."},
  {"section":"4.3.3","page":59,"text":"A bhéal cumhra, nach muid a bheidh sásta le chéile."},
  {"section":"4.3.3","page":59,"text":"Conas atá tú, a mhac bán?"},
  {"section":"4.3.3","page":59,"text":"Cad é mar atá tú inniu, a thaisce mhilis?"},
  {"section":"4.3.3","page":59,"text":"A mháthair bheag, ní bheidh deireadh go deo le do chuid oibre."},
  {"section":"4.3.4","page":59,"text":"Máire Mhór","phrase":true},
  {"section":"4.3.4","page":59,"text":"teach Mháire Mhór","phrase":true},
  {"section":"4.3.5","page":59,"text":"Is bean measartha saibhir í."},
  {"section":"4.3.5","page":59,"text":"Mná measartha saibhir is ea iad."},
  {"section":"4.3.5","page":59,"text":"Fir sách ard is ea iad."},
  {"section":"4.3.5","page":59,"text":"Páistí réasúnta ciúin is ea iad."},
  {"section":"4.3.5","page":59,"text":"Maidin sách fuar a bhí ann."},
  {"section":"4.3.5","page":59,"text":"Bliain cuibheasach tirim atá uainn."},
  {"section":"4.3.6","page":60,"text":"Is daoine an-bhreá iad."},
  {"section":"4.3.6","page":60,"text":"Déanfar na gnéithe an-tábhachtach sin a mheas."},
  {"section":"4.3.6","page":60,"text":"Ní páistí an-chiúin iad."},
  {"section":"4.3.7","page":60,"text":"Is bean mór le rá í i réimse na heolaíochta."},
  {"section":"4.3.7","page":60,"text":"Ba é údar na tuarascála cothrom le dáta a thug an cur i láthair."},
  {"section":"4.3.7","page":60,"text":"athnuachan saor in aisce","phrase":true},
  {"section":"4.3.7","page":60,"text":"tuarascáil cothrom le dáta","phrase":true},
  {"section":"4.4.1","page":60,"text":"Cár fhág sé hata an fhir mhóir?"},
  {"section":"4.4.1","page":60,"text":"Caithfear coinníollacha an chonartha bhuain a léamh go cúramach."},
  {"section":"4.4.1","page":60,"text":"Léigh sé leabhar an imreora chlúitigh nuair a foilsíodh é."},
  {"section":"4.4.1","page":60,"text":"Bhí orthu an fhéile a chur ar siúl ag deireadh an tsamhraidh fhliuch."},
  {"section":"4.4.1","page":60,"text":"Tá na páistí i rang an mhúinteora bheacht i mbliana."},
  {"section":"4.4.1","page":60,"text":"Goideadh ba an fheirmeora bhoicht."},
  {"section":"4.4.1","page":60,"text":"Ba mhaith liom labhairt le tuismitheoirí an bhuachalla chiúin."},
  {"section":"4.4.1","page":60,"text":"Bhí gach duine i bhfabhar an fheachtais thionsclaíoch."},
  {"section":"4.4.1","page":61,"text":"Tá praghas an bhia ghann ag ardú gach lá."},
  {"section":"4.4.1","page":61,"text":"Chuir costas an turais ghearr iontas orthu."},
  {"section":"4.4.1","page":61,"text":"Bhí boladh an aráin dhoinn ar fud an tí."},
  {"section":"4.4.1","page":61,"text":"Chuir sí ola ar dhoras an bhealaigh chúng."},
  {"section":"4.4.1","page":61,"text":"Labhair mé le húinéir an chapaill mhear."},
  {"section":"4.4.1","page":61,"text":"Féach ar áilleacht na spéire goirme."},
  {"section":"4.4.1","page":61,"text":"Cé hé údar na tuarascála maithe?"},
  {"section":"4.4.1","page":61,"text":"Tá guth na caillí aistí le cloisteáil ar an taifead."},
  {"section":"4.4.1","page":61,"text":"Thaitin téama na haiste iontaí liom."},
  {"section":"4.4.1","page":61,"text":"Cathain a bhraithfimid deireadh na géarchéime eacnamaíche?"},
  {"section":"4.4.1","page":61,"text":"Is maith an rud é fás na hearnála tionsclaíche."},
  {"section":"4.4.2","page":61,"text":"a fhir mhóir","phrase":true},
  {"section":"4.4.2","page":61,"text":"cóta an fhir mhóir","phrase":true},
  {"section":"4.4.3","page":62,"text":"Cá bhfuil na peileadóirí clúiteacha?"},
  {"section":"4.4.3","page":62,"text":"Foilseofar na haistí maithe san iris bhliantúil."},
  {"section":"4.4.3","page":62,"text":"Bhí na daoine uaisle i láthair inné."},
  {"section":"4.5.1","page":63,"text":"Cá bhfuil athair an fhir chóir?"},
  {"section":"4.5.1","page":63,"text":"Léigh mé tús an leabhair shuimiúil."},
  {"section":"4.5.1","page":63,"text":"Cá bhfuil athair na mná cáiliúla?"},
  {"section":"4.5.1","page":63,"text":"Léigh mé tús na haiste deacra."},
  {"section":"4.5.2","page":63,"text":"Cá bhfuil na fir cháiliúla agus na mná dathúla?"},
  {"section":"4.5.2","page":63,"text":"Léigh mé na dánta suimiúla inné."},
  {"section":"4.6.2","page":63,"text":"Tine bhreá the a bhí ann."},
  {"section":"4.6.2","page":63,"text":"Dath na tine breátha te."},
  {"section":"4.6.2","page":63,"text":"Lasadh na tinte breátha teo."},
